# MithraDirect core

Read root `AGENTS.md` for full agent guidance. README for human setup.
`docs/API_ARCHITECTURE.md` for the API layer.

- **Stack:** Vite + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + shadcn. App under `src/` — modules `marketing`, `storefront`, `vendor`. Plus one local package, `packages/api-client`.
- **HTTP is axios**, in `packages/api-client/src/client/http.ts`. `src/shared/api/client.ts` is only a re-export shim.
- **Package manager is npm** (`package-lock.json`). `pnpm-workspace.yaml` is committed but unused.
- **Not this branch:** no `apps/web`, no `src/features/*`.
- **Brand:** emerald + Poppins display + Inter body via `src/styles/global.css`. Prefer `--md-*` / shadcn vars. No purple-glow / cream-serif AI defaults.
- **UX:** one job per screen, clear primary CTA; small-vendor simplicity.
- **design-reference/** is visual reference only — not served by Vite; don’t treat as product source.
- **Never commit** `.env` or secrets. Keep diffs scoped to the task.
